e in the game. You write the single action you want to take in the game starting with >. Only reply with an action.\nFor example:\n> open cupboard\n\nIn addition to common actions, you can mator, unbal, gatic, remic, ratic and proar.\n\nYour goal for this game is: Make the inat mateny, the diale unsust and the subst dented.\n\nOnce you have achieved your goal, write \"> done\" to end the game.\n\nYou are in a cally now. There are a pante, a subst, a mical, a sness, a inat and a eness. There is a passage to a unree here.",
